      "lane": "SHELL",
      "narration_text": "So I wire it. Fifteen lines of JSON — matcher: Write, Edit, MultiEdit; command: python3 the hook, expanded to the project directory. That's the whole handoff. The model wrote the mechanism it can't approve; the human approves the mechanism the model wrote. That's the split you want on anything that changes what Claude Code is allowed to do.",
